Package: aemet2fdata
Type: Package
Title: Download and Convert AEMET OpenData to Functional Data
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Manuel",
           family = "Oviedo de la Fuente",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "manuel.oviedo@udc.es",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7360-3249"))
Description: Provides tools to download daily meteorological data from the
    AEMET (Spanish State Meteorological Agency) OpenData API and convert them
    into functional data objects ('fdata' and 'ldata') of the 'fda.usc'
    package, with one curve per station and year. Long periods can be
    downloaded per station in half-year windows to one CSV file per station
    (UTF-8), or for all stations with a resumable bulk download to local
    files.
URL: https://moviedo5.github.io/aemet2fdata/,
    https://github.com/moviedo5/aemet2fdata
BugReports: https://github.com/moviedo5/aemet2fdata/issues
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    fda.usc,
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
